Did not wake.'"},{"x":14.2,"z":9.8,"label":"An iron bed","text":"Whoever lay here stopped speaking in the night. The sheet is turned back with great care, as if for someone who might come back to it.","act":"Look under the pillow","res":"A folded note in a nurse's hand: 'Stopped speaking 3.07. Smiling. Did not wake.'"},{"x":3.7,"z":3.4,"label":"A hurricane lamp","text":"Trimmed low. Beside it a cup of tea gone cold, and a chair nobody has sat in since midnight."},{"x":9.7,"z":3.4,"label":"A hurricane lamp","text":"Trimmed low. Beside it a cup of tea gone cold, and a chair nobody has sat in since midnight."},{"x":6.7,"z":8.6,"label":"A hurricane lamp","text":"Trimmed low. Beside it a cup of tea gone cold, and a chair nobody has sat in since midnight."},{"x":12.7,"z":8.6,"label":"A hurricane lamp","text":"Trimmed low. Beside it a cup of tea gone cold, and a chair nobody has sat in since midnight."},{"x":17.6,"z":3.2,"label":"The sister's desk","text":"A ward register, a pen, a watch pinned to a blotter. The last entry is half a line long.","act":"Read the register","res":"Forty-one names in three weeks. Each with a note: 'Quiet from' and a time an hour earlier."},{"x":18.4,"z":9.6,"label":"The stove","text":"Banked down. Something has been burned in it lately: paper, and a little cloth.","act":"Look in the ashes","res":"A scrap of paper, scorched: '...please. Somebody. Hear me say it.'"},{"x":17.6,"z":5.2,"label":"A gramophone","text":"A trophy of Ward 6. A record is on it: a music-hall song, very loud.","act":"Wind it up","res":"It plays, dreadfully, at full volume. Along the ward, forty heads turn. For a moment it is not quiet at all."}],"npcs":[{"x":16.2,"z":6.3,"label":"Sister Marlow","portrait":"../assets/painted/a/wars-f-05.jpg"}],"start":[10,9.5]},"view":{"W":1600,"H":925,"k":71.42857142857143,"sin":0.788010753606722,"cos":0.6156614753256583,"tilt":0.9075712110370514,"cx":10,"cz":4.984328685541268},"collide":[[0,0,20,0],[3.35,0,4.65,0],[8.35,0,9.65,0],[13.35,0,